{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門有車輛起火。今日（10日）下午4時53分，警方接獲途人報案，指於湖山路、湖山草地滾球場遊樂場對開，發現一輛旅遊巴起火。消防接報到場，將火救</p><p>現場影片可見，旅遊巴一度冒出烈焰，整架車包括車轆位置不斷湧出濃煙。據報，旅遊巴早更司機於下午4時許將車泊於上址，停車熄匙後再將車匙交予下更，惟夜更司機前去取車已驚見旅遊巴冒煙。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260510/1130253613185110016586703.png/GQHFw4qR-sbZcGl-qezfE0qTETOv-KBbwuUgYsLlIGI\" alt=\"旅遊巴車轆位置不斷湧出濃煙。（Threads@lot3tol影片截圖）\"><figcaption>旅遊巴車轆位置不斷湧出濃煙。（Threads@lot3tol影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130497818830573568540268.jpeg/XgIR5vjL_c3L42da9xPFeongSuDPIOTa2o4rBdqOKwU\" alt=\"起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）\"><figcaption>起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130497821049491456560489.jpeg/u7UwUkichJkCpcexuGPJnpPZgdU-oOkKC56IZAueiGQ\" alt=\"起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）\"><figcaption>起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130497823297769472236940.jpeg/X2Mz3sYbUMXnEbdUYUfG12gTgOLH1vmlMEAMTTBADE0\" alt=\"起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈，消防到場灌救。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）\"><figcaption>起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈，消防到場灌救。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130497825499910144271493.jpeg/ATSY8Aj4FF-rB9mSnUJhDkBHqZTc6npyvHOiErxzohI\" alt=\"起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈，消防到場灌救。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）\"><figcaption>起火旅遊巴一度火勢猛烈，消防到場灌救。（「Carcam Hong Kong 香港車」facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260510/1130253616490352640012649.jpeg/I7072YjsP1IVUSCKDQ6zLXthewHo_mqNlx3DoZcdw6E\" alt=\"屯門湖山路有旅遊巴起火冒煙，消防到場撲熄。（Threads@lot3tol）\"><figcaption>屯門湖山路有旅遊巴起火冒煙，消防到場撲熄。（Threads@lot3tol）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-11T05:35:21.606896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":429,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}